# Yomi16 config fragment — bo sung DroidSpaces
#
# Nguon: arch/arm64/configs/extras/droidspaces.config (blob 37687f50ad) cua nhanh
# oos-miniBpf54 va oos-miniBpf54-staging cua OOS-COS-For-Vayu/kernel_vayu_sm8150.
# Da doc 71 dong cau hinh cua fragment do va so sanh voi vayu_defconfig hien tai:
# 58/71 da thoa san, nen khong dua them vao day. 13 dong con lai xu ly nhu sau:
#
#   - 4 ten viet theo kernel 5.x, da quy ve ten dung cho 4.14 (ghi chu duoi)
#   - 3 trung lap, vayu_defconfig da co san
#   - 1 hong vi cau truc cay (xem vayu_defconfig dong 1232)
#   - 2 khong ton tai trong Kconfig 4.14 → loai khoi danh sach
#
# QUY TAC VIET FRAGMENT NAY (da hoc tu scripts/kconfig/merge_config.sh dong 102):
#   sed "s/^\(# \)\{0,1\}\(CONFIG_[a-zA-Z0-9_]*\)[= ].*/\2/p"
#   - KHONG duoc viet dong comment bat dau bang "# CONFIG_..." — regex se quay no
#     thanh assignment that va ghi de gia tri trong .config.
#   - KHONG duoc them comment cuoi dong tren dong assignment — merge_config.sh lay
#     NGUYEN DONG lam gia tri moi, comment se lam hong.
#   Chi duoc comment o dong rieng, va text tren phai khong bat dau bang CONFIG_.

# --- Core namespace: tach IPC cho container ---
# depends on (SYSVIPC || POSIX_MQUEUE) — ca hai deu =y san
# GHI CHU: dong nay hien KHONG doi gi — olddefconfig da tu bat IP_C_NS theo
# "default y" trong init/Kconfig dong 1012. Giu lai de explicit intent va de
# khong bi mat neu Kconfig default doi. Bai test config da xac nhan.
CONFIG_IPC_NS=y

# --- ipset: bang dia chi cho luat iptables ---
# IP_SET la menuconfig tai net/netfilter/ipset/Kconfig dong 1
# depends on INET && NETFILTER — ca hai deu =y san
CONFIG_IP_SET=y
# depends on IP_SET — phai bat IP_SET truoc, neu khong Kconfig se loai
CONFIG_IP_SET_HASH_IP=y
# depends on IP_SET
CONFIG_IP_SET_HASH_NET=y
# depends on IP_SET && NETFILTER_ADVANCED — ca hai deu =y san
CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_SET=y

# --- netfilter ---
# depends on NETFILTER_ADVANCED — =y san. Match "state" thi vayu_defconfig co san
CONFIG_NETFILTER_XT_MATCH_RECENT=y

# --- conntrack qua netlink cho Docker-style port mapping ---
# Fragment ghi "NF_CONNTRACK_NETLINK" — ten kernel 5.x. Ten dung 4.14 la
# NF_CT_NETLINK (net/netfilter/Kconfig dong 338). Tu dong select NETFILTER_NETLINK.
# GHI CHU: dong nay hien KHONG doi gi — da =y san truoc khi merge. Giu lai de
# explicit intent. Bai test config da xac nhan.
CONFIG_NF_CT_NETLINK=y

# --- Link-Time Optimization ---
# arch/Kconfig:657 — depends on ARCH_SUPPORTS_LTO_CLANG (=y san)
# depends on !FTRACE_MCOUNT_RECORD || HAVE_C_RECORDMCOUNT (=y san)
#                   depends on !KASAN (KASAN khong bat o day)
#                   select LTO + THIN_ARCHIVES
# arch/Kconfig:641 — depends on LTO_CLANG && ARCH_SUPPORTS_THINLTO
# Makefile:913-915 se sua thanh:
# lto-clang-flags := -flto=thin
# LDFLAGS += --thinlto-cache-dir=.thinlto-cache
#
# CANH BAO: lan truoc CI fail o vdso.so.dbg voi "-EL: not found".
# Da them buoc chan doan trong .github/workflows/build.yml de biet LD/AS
# that la gi truoc kha fix.
CONFIG_LTO_CLANG=y
CONFIG_THINLTO=y

# --- Link-Time Optimization: TAT CO (ghi chu lan truoc, giu lai de sau xem) ---
# Da thu bat CONFIG_LTO_CLANG=y + CONFIG_THINLTO=y (run 37077078607) → CI fail
# o buoc link vdso.so.dbg:
#     /bin/sh: 0: Illegal option -L
#     /bin/sh: 1: -EL: not found
#     make[2]: *** [arch/arm64/kernel/vdso/Makefile:33] Error 127
# clang-11 khong nhan -EL. Nguyen do chua xac dinh — co the do LTO, co the
# do config. Da rollback ve trang thai chay xanh (run 36998906802).
#
# Neu muon bat lai LTO, sua ba cho trong .github/workflows/build.yml truoc:
#   -7 config can verify -> 9
#   -MAKE_JOBS: 2 -> bo dong comment LTO
#
# Ghi chu them: cay kernel nay KHONG co Kconfig cho BOLT/MLGO/PGO (da quet toan
# bo Kconfig, khong co symbol nao chua cac ten do). Day la post-link tool ben
# ngoai, can script rieng — khong bai duoc bang Kconfig. Bien "+pgo +bolt
# +mlgo" tren ban OPTIMUS la do build script cua dev them, khong phai config.
# Ubuntu 22.04 llvm-11 con khong co llvm-bolt (BOLT vao LLVM chinh thuc tu 12).

# --- KPROBES ---
# Bat cho moi variant. SukiSU-Ultra Kconfig dong 5: `depends on KPROBES &&
# EXT4_FS` → khong co KPROBES thi khong build duoc.
# Da verify bat duoc: arch/Kconfig `config KPROBES` chi depends on
# MODULES (=y) va HAVE_KPROBES (=y).
# Khong xung dot voi choice KSU (choice chi co TRACEPOINT/MANUAL/SUSFS).
CONFIG_KPROBES=y
